        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #25S Stainless Steel Door Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #25S features the contemporarily style square rose with the <a href=\"/products/designer-stainless-steel-door-lever-set-omnia-25\">Omnia #25 stainless steel lever</a>. Though great for modern homes of all sizes, its sleek design draws heavily from New York apartment living, overlooking the lights of the urban-chic lifestyle. The mounting screws are totally concealed to complete the clean and contemporary look expected from Omnia door hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57026-SM.jpg?v=1704354616\" width=\"358\" height=\"177\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 25S Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/designer-stainless-steel-door-lever-set-omnia-25\"><b>Omnia #25 Lever with Round Rose</b></a> and  matching <a href=\"/products/square-stainless-steel-single-cylinder-deadbolt-omnia-d9000sa\"><b>Square Stainless Deadbolt</b></a> for entry doors that require security locks.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Designer Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #25S Square Rose Stainless Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Designer Stainless Steel Door Lever Set with Square Rose",
